（11/13の5分足・AI）</div><div class=\"fprof\"><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:46px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">9時</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:27px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\"></span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:12px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">10時</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:11px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\"></span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:15px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">11時</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:29px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">12時半</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:7px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\"></span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:4px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">13時半</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:17px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\"></span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:16px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">14時半</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:17px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">引け</span></div></div><div class=\"fplegend\">時間帯ごとの出来高（どの時間に売買が集中したか）</div><div class=\"fact\"><span>この日の値動き</span><span class=\"num\">-5.4%（値幅9.6%）</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>出来高（普段の日足平均との比）</span><span class=\"num\">2.1倍</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>終値とVWAP（1日の平均約定価格）の差</span><span class=\"num\">-3.57%</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>寄り30分／引け30分の出来高シェア</span><span class=\"num\">23% ／ 8%</span></div><div class=\"fsub\">裏にいそうな売買主体（機械推定・上位2件）</div><div class=\"factor\"><div class=\"factorh\">🎯 個人の狼狽売り・損切り<span class=\"fconf\">一致度85・確度高</span></div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・日中-5.4%の下げ＋出来高2.1倍（損切りの投げが出た形）</div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・ほぼ安値引け（投げがまだ吸収されていない）</div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・引けにかけて安値を更新（翌日に売り残りの可能性）</div></div><div class=\"factor\"><div class=\"factorh\">👤 大口の売り抜け（戻り売り・はめ込み警戒）<span class=\"fconf\">一致度55・確度中</span></div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・高値から売り込まれて引け＋出来高増（戻りを売る大口の典型）</div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・安値圏で引け</div></div><div class=\"discnote\">リアルタイムの板（気配値・注文残）は取引所の有料データのため、場中の5分足の値動きと出来高の「形」から典型パターンとの一致度で推定しています。実際の注文主体を特定するものではありません。寄り集中＝個人の飛びつき、引け集中＋VWAP沿い＝機関の執行、出来高増なのに値幅が静か＝大口の仕込み、といった市場の経験則を採点式にしたものです。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,27.6 9.1,25.3 14.2,29.6 19.3,37.3 24.5,33.4 29.6,38.4 34.7,40.9 39.8,48.2 44.9,34.8 50.0,28.4 55.1,30.1 60.3,27.3 65.4,29.7 70.5,28.2 75.6,24.9 80.7,12.8 85.8,19.7 91.0,27.1 96.1,29.7 101.2,28.1 106.3,34.1 111.4,36.9 116.5,38.7 121.6,40.4 126.8,37.2 131.9,37.5 137.0,37.4 142.1,34.7 147.2,38.1 152.3,35.7 157.4,42.5 162.6,41.9 167.7,41.6 172.8,42.6 177.9,32.3 183.0,41.4 188.1,40.8 193.2,40.9 198.4,41.3 203.5,39.9 208.6,40.1 213.7,40.3 218.8,44.7 223.9,44.8 229.0,40.3 234.2,46.4 239.3,42.6 244.4,40.1 249.5,42.9 254.6,35.8 259.7,34.3 264.9,31.4 270.0,25.8 275.1,23.2 280.2,36.3 285.3,40.4 290.4,40.6 295.5,37.8 300.7,40.7 305.8,42.4 310.9,47.7 316.0,97.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"97.2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 7.9,93.2 11.9,86.9 15.8,80.2 19.8,81.7 23.7,85.4 27.7,73.5 31.6,39.1 35.6,